Z||000004||Fierokid87||07-20-2001||03:22 AM||||Ok time to clear this up.  The tip has nothing to do with the sound of the exaust.  Its the muffler and the size of the pipe you have from the manifold, or the Header.  The tips is for looks,  And also an different intake will make the exaust sound a bit different.<P>Scott<P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="BLOODY"> Fierokid's  Web site<BR>http://www.angelfire.com/sports/sfiero<P>AIM: Fierokid87<BR>ICQ: Fierokid</FONT><P>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sfiero.JPG"> ||||reg||3
Z||000005||1FST2M6||07-20-2001||08:47 AM||||welcome to the forum... <P>for  tips.. exhaust or mushroom, check <A HREF="http://www.nopi.com" TARGET=_blank>www.nopi.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.powertone.com" TARGET=_blank>www.powertone.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.brullenexhaust.com" TARGET=_blank>www.brullenexhaust.com</A>  <A HREF="http://www.jegs.com" TARGET=_blank>www.jegs.com</A>  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fst-rear-tag.jpg"> <BR>Brullen 3.5" with Brullen 2.5" Muffler and Catco 2.5" cat... oh it's a V6 though...  <BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||MinnGreenGT||07-20-2001||02:58 PM||||You should also check with Pacesetter... I have a set of Monza Baffle Tips on my 3.1L GT...and no muffler- I had someone at the Dells Run this year tell me they thought I had a V8 in the Car! (so... it's a little loud on long trips, but hey- it sounds so nice to me.)  I also have a Bored-Out intake, port & polished heads, a ported exhaust manifold, and a high-flow CAT.  Like others though, I'm not sure what that would be like on 4 Cyl?||||reg||1
Z||000007||Joe Torma||07-20-2001||04:37 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Fierokid87:<BR><B>The tip has nothing to do with the sound of the exaust.  Its the muffler and the size of the pipe you have from the manifold, or the Header.  The tips is for looks,  And also an different intake will make the exaust sound a bit different.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>[Some] tips WILL change the sound of the exhaust note.  Some work like a megaphone.  Stock fiero V6 has "megaphones."  Also, some tips are resonated and some aren't.  Many of the Coffee Can ones are resonated and do change the sound.<P>Joe<P>||||reg||1
Z||000008||Mach10||07-21-2001||06:20 PM||||Actually, ANYTHING on the exhaust system will change the sound. Now are the changes audible? Maybe not. The big tip will make it behave like a trumpet. IMHO. And make it look wrong. Any car.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"><BR>Gimme a nice dual tip any day.||||reg||1
